{
  "name": "@xpert-ai/plugin-context-editing",
  "displayName": {
    "en_US": "Context editing middleware",
    "zh_Hans": "上下文编辑中间件"
  },
  "description": {
    "en_US": "Context Editing Middleware that automatically prunes tool results to manage context size. This middleware mirrors Anthropic's context editing capabilities by clearing older tool results once the conversation grows beyond a configurable token threshold. The implementation is intentionally model-agnostic so it can be used with any AI model.",
    "zh_Hans": "提供上下文编辑中间件，自动修剪工具结果以管理上下文大小。该中间件通过在对话超过可配置的令牌阈值时清除较旧的工具结果，模拟了Anthropic的上下文编辑功能。该实现故意与模型无关，因此可以与任何AI模型一起使用。"
  },
  "category": "middleware",
  "keywords": ["context", "middleware", "agent"],
